// purpose: This query enriches the *GraphAPIAuditEvents* with Application information Using the Azure_Application_ID list developed by [@Beercow](https://github.com/Beercow) 1000+ AppIds can be enriched with the [externaldata operator](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/kusto/query/externald
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Graph%20API/GraphAPIAuditEvents%20-%20AppEnrichmentExternalData.md
